cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "TwinInvalidate"
abstract: "Model-invalidation monitor for a digital twin — CUSUM, EWMA and windowed GLR with thresholds set from a declared false-alarm target rather than tuned to the result, detection-delay against false-alarm-rate (ARL0/ARL1) curves per change type for a parameter step, a slow ramp and a noise-variance change, and an explicit statement that twin invalidation and asset fault are not distinguishable from the residual; learned drift classifier on windowed residual features against the analytic GLR baseline."
type: software
